WEBVTT

00:01.060 --> 00:02.360
<i>We're canceling the operation!</i>

00:02.360 --> 00:03.560
<i>Retreat!</i>

00:03.560 --> 00:04.480
<i>I repeat!</i>

00:04.480 --> 00:06.570
<i>We're canceling the operation! Retreat!</i>

00:08.610 --> 00:10.910
You're kidding me, John!

00:11.240 --> 00:12.990
We're canceling the operation! Retreat!

00:13.280 --> 00:14.990
<i>We're canceling the operation! Retreat!</i>

00:17.700 --> 00:18.620
Retreat!

00:20.120 --> 00:21.420
All hands, retreat!

00:35.720 --> 00:37.720
Slaughterer of chaos...

00:38.100 --> 00:42.980
I did not think I could exert
this much power against a human.

00:43.350 --> 00:45.770
You are willing to call me a human...

00:45.770 --> 00:48.650
even though I am in this guise?

00:48.650 --> 00:51.650
Appearance is trivial.

00:51.650 --> 00:53.660
I know not your name...

00:54.370 --> 00:58.330
but I promise I will engrave
this past battle into my heart.

00:59.410 --> 01:01.830
I'm sorry, Master.

02:40.300 --> 02:45.730
<i>I shall make the Little Red Riding Hood
burned within you fade.</i>

02:46.890 --> 02:49.480
<i>Participate in the Holy Grail War...</i>

02:49.480 --> 02:51.320
<i>Ayaka Sajyou.</i>

02:51.770 --> 02:56.650
<i>If you don't want to be devoured
by Little Red Riding Hood.</i>

02:59.450 --> 03:01.330
Saber...

03:21.850 --> 03:23.970
We should hide. It's dangerous.

03:23.970 --> 03:24.770
No.

03:25.270 --> 03:27.090
As Master of the King of Heroes,

03:27.090 --> 03:30.190
I have a duty to continue
watching him to the very end.

03:34.110 --> 03:37.780
I do not have many elements
that allow me to reach you.

03:38.320 --> 03:39.240
However...

03:44.700 --> 03:47.330
When it comes to speed, I can win!

03:48.080 --> 03:49.290
<i>Ex...</i>

03:49.290 --> 03:50.710
<i>calibur!</i>

03:51.210 --> 03:52.500
How naive!

03:56.010 --> 03:57.970
<i>Excalibur!</i>

04:00.930 --> 04:02.600
<i>Excalibur!</i>

04:05.430 --> 04:06.720
<i>Ex...</i>

04:07.850 --> 04:09.230
<i>calibur!</i>

04:11.230 --> 04:12.650
Why you little...

04:16.070 --> 04:17.070
<i>Ex...</i>

04:20.820 --> 04:23.740
<i>calibur!</i>

04:28.960 --> 04:32.040
Miss, is your body feeling all right?

04:32.040 --> 04:33.290
Huh?

04:33.290 --> 04:35.750
Oh, come to think of it,
I might be feeling a little sluggish.

04:36.800 --> 04:38.300
"A little"?

04:38.880 --> 04:40.170
Miss...

04:41.840 --> 04:43.390
What...

04:43.390 --> 04:44.850
<i>are </i>you?

04:47.810 --> 04:52.600
Tsubaki Kuruoka's room is the rightmost
one from our viewpoint on the top floor.

04:52.600 --> 04:54.020
Much appreciated.

04:54.020 --> 04:55.980
Leave the rest to me.

04:56.570 --> 04:58.480
No, wait a minute.

05:03.110 --> 05:04.370
I'll go with you.

05:13.120 --> 05:15.920
You've made a wise choice, boy.

05:17.040 --> 05:18.880
Say earlier...

05:18.880 --> 05:23.890
if you had left this lovely lady behind
and retreated by yourself...

05:24.470 --> 05:29.470
I would have carved your heart out,
crushed it, kneaded it with sand...

05:29.470 --> 05:33.600
and scattered it into the slop
for pigs to feed on!

05:35.100 --> 05:38.900
But you really made the worst choice.

05:39.980 --> 05:42.200
I will never allow
a diminutive human...

05:42.200 --> 05:48.490
to even attempt walking
alongside my beloved!

05:49.540 --> 05:50.950
<i>Envelop in the black blades...</i>

05:51.790 --> 05:53.080
<i>Zabani—</i>

05:55.210 --> 05:56.540
Jester Karture.

05:57.380 --> 05:59.250
How many bullets...

05:59.250 --> 06:01.130
are left within you?

06:02.970 --> 06:04.590
Damn you.

06:04.590 --> 06:07.090
How'd you get intel on me?

06:16.400 --> 06:18.980
Are you all right, Mr. Jack?

06:22.740 --> 06:24.110
Master...

06:27.200 --> 06:30.330
You transported a half-dead Heroic Spirit?

06:30.740 --> 06:35.330
You are likely the only fool
who would use a Command Spell for this.

06:37.750 --> 06:40.550
If we defeat that person, will Mr. Ja...

06:40.550 --> 06:43.510
Berserker's Spirit Origin revive?

06:43.510 --> 06:45.760
Jack is fine now.

06:45.760 --> 06:47.760
You see it, don't you?

06:47.760 --> 06:48.800
Yes.

06:48.800 --> 06:51.720
The Spirit Origins have fused within him.

06:51.720 --> 06:53.470
It's as if they melted together...

06:53.470 --> 06:55.560
inside something that looks like mud.

06:55.560 --> 06:58.150
I'm afraid that even if you defeat him...

06:58.150 --> 07:00.690
my power will not return to me.

07:01.070 --> 07:06.110
Not unless I truly disappear
and then get resummoned from the Throne.

07:06.110 --> 07:10.870
But if we do so, will that Mr. Jack
be a different person than you are now?

07:13.540 --> 07:14.500
Wait.

07:15.040 --> 07:17.000
Stop right there, whoever it is!

07:18.080 --> 07:19.670
Oh brother.

07:19.670 --> 07:23.380
You shouldn't make an
author do physical labor.

07:24.090 --> 07:26.420
My name is Dumas.

07:26.420 --> 07:28.800
Alexandre Dumas.

07:28.800 --> 07:30.140
Ever heard of me?

07:30.140 --> 07:32.430
<i>What? Why would a Heroic Spirit
disclose his True Name—</i>

07:33.100 --> 07:34.970
M-Mr. Dumas? Which one?

07:35.350 --> 07:37.230
The general under Napoleon?

07:37.230 --> 07:38.940
Or the author of <i>The Three Musketeers</i>?

07:39.350 --> 07:41.610
No, perhaps <i>The Lady of the Camellias</i>?

07:41.610 --> 07:44.440
The second one. You sure know your stuff.

07:44.820 --> 07:47.610
Of course I would know!

07:47.610 --> 07:51.620
I watched the movie, the anime and
the puppet play of <i>The Three Musketeers</i>!

07:51.620 --> 07:53.330
Well, I thank you for that.

07:53.830 --> 07:57.540
But you're pretty difficult
to figure out, kid.

07:58.000 --> 08:02.750
You jumped into the conversation
while setting up a spell in my shadow.

08:02.750 --> 08:05.170
That's definitely a Mage. However...

08:05.920 --> 08:07.840
even when the spell was completed,

08:07.840 --> 08:11.140
you got worked up and kept talking
about <i>The Three Musketeers</i>.

08:11.140 --> 08:12.640
That's not like a Mage.

08:13.100 --> 08:18.270
Huh? I mean, I set it up because I'd be
in danger if you were an enemy.

08:18.270 --> 08:22.060
But if I executed it and you weren't
an enemy, I'd be wasting Magical Energy,

08:22.060 --> 08:24.270
and it would be bad for you.

08:25.860 --> 08:29.570
You know, kid,
you don't act like a Mage...

08:30.450 --> 08:36.330
but are you prepared to throw your life
into a pot for your objective?

08:45.090 --> 08:46.920
This is not mere recklessness, either.

08:48.380 --> 08:49.880
W-Wait, that's...

08:55.680 --> 08:57.180
So, you can still move.

09:01.640 --> 09:03.350
Ridiculous. Hmm?

09:12.490 --> 09:15.780
Mage, you have come out of the cellar.

09:24.960 --> 09:26.500
<i>P-P-Play Ball!</i>

09:31.720 --> 09:32.880
Master!

09:33.340 --> 09:36.640
<i>I'll leave it up to the boy
whether he does it or not.</i>

09:37.140 --> 09:38.680
<i>Jack the Ripper.</i>

09:38.680 --> 09:42.230
<i>Being able to become anyone
is the best ingredient ever.</i>

09:42.230 --> 09:47.860
<i>By mixing that and the boy's presence,
I can fortify your powers temporarily.</i>

09:48.150 --> 09:51.650
<i>But I can't even imagine what kind
of side effects the Master will have...</i>

09:51.650 --> 09:55.070
<i>after being stewed with a street slasher.</i>

09:56.950 --> 09:59.200
<i>Oh? Is that it?</i>

09:59.200 --> 10:00.370
<i>Huh?</i>

10:03.410 --> 10:06.500
<i>Musketeers' Masquerade!</i>

10:07.540 --> 10:08.500
What?

10:14.010 --> 10:15.760
<i>Game Select!</i>

10:24.190 --> 10:26.790
Running through a part of
Mr. Jack's Noble Phantasm power

10:26.810 --> 10:28.480
you stole is a spell I injected...

10:28.480 --> 10:31.730
that confuses the flow of Magical Energy.

10:32.240 --> 10:33.990
There's no way you can do that—

10:33.990 --> 10:36.860
It would have been impossible
unless I got this close.

10:37.620 --> 10:40.830
Y-You could have transformed
into your Master and casted the spell.

10:40.830 --> 10:43.200
That would have been the same.

10:43.200 --> 10:48.170
Why did your Master take the risk
to stand on the battlefield?

10:48.580 --> 10:51.210
Because he holds something that I cannot.

10:51.550 --> 10:56.130
Archer's Master has already used up
all the Command Spells, right?

10:56.130 --> 10:58.180
If there was even one stroke left,

10:58.180 --> 11:01.350
the power of that connection
would have repelled it.

11:01.350 --> 11:04.180
You have eyes
that can see through that deeply!

11:04.180 --> 11:05.100
However...

11:05.100 --> 11:06.350
I'm not done yet!

11:12.360 --> 11:13.570
At this rate—

11:14.650 --> 11:17.360
The actor showed some courage.

11:17.360 --> 11:21.200
That makes me want to
fix up the logic a bit.

11:22.660 --> 11:24.910
Guys like you are the ones...

11:26.160 --> 11:28.330
that should become heroes.

11:28.870 --> 11:29.880
You are...

11:31.210 --> 11:32.380
John!

12:04.290 --> 12:05.870
<i>Game Over.</i>

12:07.000 --> 12:10.370
You used the Hydra's venom.

12:12.420 --> 12:13.590
But...

12:13.590 --> 12:18.380
the power given to you
is not a god's blessing.

12:18.840 --> 12:21.470
It is a power created
by humans and the earth.

12:21.470 --> 12:23.890
I praise you, my brother...

12:23.890 --> 12:24.760
and...

12:25.060 --> 12:27.600
I pity you, brave hero!

12:28.020 --> 12:30.810
This tainted blood of mine...

12:30.810 --> 12:34.190
The flames of revenge
harboring within my soul...

12:35.110 --> 12:39.610
cannot be stained by a mere deadly poison!

12:43.160 --> 12:44.910
What is he about to do?

12:47.500 --> 12:49.540
What exactly are you?

12:49.540 --> 12:51.370
What do you mean?

12:51.370 --> 12:56.050
It's unusual to be able to supply that
much Magical Energy to a Heroic Spirit.

12:56.050 --> 13:00.550
At the very least, you'd have to be
a top-tier Mage to do so.

13:01.260 --> 13:04.060
You say that, but I
really don't understand

13:04.090 --> 13:06.890
this Magical Energy stuff to begin with.

13:07.640 --> 13:08.770
Miss...

13:09.520 --> 13:12.270
What <i>are</i> you?

13:16.020 --> 13:19.690
I was planning on eradicating you,
church and all.

13:25.700 --> 13:28.410
<i>I have become curious
about this thing's fate.</i>

13:29.290 --> 13:30.370
<i>Gilgamesh...</i>

13:30.660 --> 13:33.790
<i>You did the same for me once upon a time.</i>

13:35.170 --> 13:38.170
You thought of protecting this location?

13:38.460 --> 13:40.630
I ought to sneer at your arrogance
and slay you here...

13:41.880 --> 13:45.760
but by nullifying that attack,
you've earned my acknowledgement.

13:47.680 --> 13:49.100
<i>That is...</i>

13:49.100 --> 13:50.810
<i>an honor.</i>

13:59.820 --> 14:01.490
Saber?

14:07.450 --> 14:09.660
We can win. We can win...

14:10.490 --> 14:11.870
Lord Gilgamesh!

14:19.460 --> 14:21.010
Mongrel...

14:21.010 --> 14:24.220
What are you hiding within you?

14:24.760 --> 14:26.760
What are you talking about?

14:27.600 --> 14:31.100
I'm not talking about your entourage.

14:31.100 --> 14:34.140
I'm talking about the source
of your own Spirit Origin.

14:35.270 --> 14:41.190
In any case, it appears
you still lack a true reason to fight.

14:41.570 --> 14:45.150
To dare challenge me
while in such an emotional state...

14:45.990 --> 14:49.780
Now that is flagrant conceit, mongrel.

14:50.450 --> 14:52.830
I shall execute judgment.

14:52.830 --> 14:55.870
Have you any final words before I do?

14:56.290 --> 14:59.590
I'd like to say I don't, but...

14:59.590 --> 15:00.630
let's see...

15:01.800 --> 15:06.050
The girl that has provided
my Magical Energy is not a Master.

15:06.050 --> 15:09.640
It was one-sided exploitation on my part.

15:10.100 --> 15:14.600
She bares you no hostility,
so please make allowances for her.

15:15.310 --> 15:16.480
All right.

15:16.890 --> 15:21.570
However, if I find her existence trivial,
I shall blast her away without hesitation.

15:21.570 --> 15:24.610
No different from the rest of the rabble.

15:25.280 --> 15:27.860
Mongrel, the judgment on you—

15:32.370 --> 15:33.740
What a tactless act!

15:34.660 --> 15:37.500
You came to settle the
score before you died off?

15:38.710 --> 15:41.380
However, you thought I could not purify...

15:41.380 --> 15:44.010
that tiny portion of tainted mud?

15:45.010 --> 15:46.880
Strong king...

15:46.880 --> 15:48.720
and weak warrior!

15:49.640 --> 15:52.930
What will slaughter you is not that taint!

15:52.930 --> 15:53.680
Oh?

15:53.970 --> 15:56.270
It is what drowns in that mud!

15:56.270 --> 15:58.020
The corpses!

15:58.020 --> 16:02.110
My distinguished enemy
and pitiful fellow...

16:02.110 --> 16:05.150
you shall dance within my mad rush!

16:05.900 --> 16:07.360
<i>Nine Lives!</i>

16:14.660 --> 16:17.370
I shall personally appraise you...

16:17.960 --> 16:23.460
and see how much that hide of yours
recognizes the crafts of humans!

16:35.350 --> 16:37.140
Hydra venom, huh?

16:37.520 --> 16:40.140
I already have plenty
of such poison in my stores.

16:40.850 --> 16:43.860
Nothing less from you, my king!

17:05.090 --> 17:06.500
So...

17:06.840 --> 17:09.470
the Holy Grail can even summon
something of this caliber?

17:18.640 --> 17:19.600
Huh?

17:30.740 --> 17:32.320
We have an interruption.

17:33.280 --> 17:35.870
I did not expect you to stray here.

17:36.660 --> 17:37.990
So...

17:37.990 --> 17:40.120
you have fallen that far...

17:40.540 --> 17:43.170
Ishtar, goddess of fertility!

17:44.040 --> 17:47.550
"Fallen"? That's quite a
terrible way to say it!

17:48.210 --> 17:52.130
The higher ground I've obtained
hasn't changed from the beginning.

17:52.510 --> 17:57.010
You simply thought
you climbed higher than all of us.

17:57.470 --> 18:00.890
You got carried away
and left your Master behind, too!

18:00.890 --> 18:03.690
A Holy Grail War isn't
something so easy...

18:03.690 --> 18:06.310
that you could make it through and win
without a united front.

18:06.310 --> 18:07.360
You know that, right?

18:07.860 --> 18:10.860
More like, you don't feel
the intense pain of the poison yet?

18:11.240 --> 18:15.410
Hurry up and roll around the ground
to make me laugh!

18:15.410 --> 18:19.370
That arrogance plastered onto your soul
does not dissipate...

18:19.370 --> 18:22.120
even after millennia have passed.

18:22.120 --> 18:26.580
To make me walk through
such a clammy cave alone...

18:26.580 --> 18:29.210
is worth certain death.

18:30.170 --> 18:31.630
A cave...

18:33.170 --> 18:39.060
Well, thanks to that, I found
something useful in order to kill you.

18:39.560 --> 18:40.970
The key to the vault!

18:41.350 --> 18:42.930
Why you...

18:43.390 --> 18:47.230
It's something that is of no use
to an ordinary human.

18:47.230 --> 18:51.440
But I can lock it up again, at the least.

18:52.400 --> 18:57.240
Closing the door before my treasures
dazzles your eyes...

18:57.240 --> 18:59.580
I said you had fallen,
but I stand corrected.

19:00.160 --> 19:02.950
You have become quite laudable!

19:03.330 --> 19:04.580
Or...

19:04.580 --> 19:07.250
did that vessel affect you?

19:07.250 --> 19:09.040
That didn't happen.

19:09.040 --> 19:13.920
This body is a doll that was created
only to become a vessel.

19:14.670 --> 19:16.880
Just like this little one.

19:17.430 --> 19:20.550
To think I made a misjudgment...

19:20.550 --> 19:25.690
You are not the actual being,
but an inferior reverberation.

19:26.600 --> 19:28.900
I wanted to play around a bit more...

19:28.900 --> 19:31.900
but going further
would make things a bit troublesome.

19:32.780 --> 19:34.360
What?

19:39.700 --> 19:42.030
Perhaps it is the curse itself?

19:42.030 --> 19:43.870
I think it'd be best to flee.

19:44.200 --> 19:46.460
I made an effort
to avoid your vital spots...

19:46.460 --> 19:48.960
so you should agonize as long as you can!

19:50.040 --> 19:51.960
Or so I'd like to say.

19:52.880 --> 19:54.510
Even if I let it slide...

19:54.840 --> 19:57.380
I don't think this little
guy is so forgiving.

20:31.790 --> 20:33.500
- Lord Gilgamesh!
- Lady Tiné!

20:33.500 --> 20:34.710
It's dangerous!

20:35.170 --> 20:36.170
No!

20:36.960 --> 20:37.670
No!

20:39.380 --> 20:42.600
Nooooo!

20:43.640 --> 20:45.010
Oh brother.

20:45.010 --> 20:49.770
At this rate, the audience, the stage...
everything will burn down to cinders.

20:50.230 --> 20:51.480
If so...

20:51.810 --> 20:55.690
I should lower the curtains
with my own hands.

20:55.980 --> 20:58.110
This might be really bad!

21:02.700 --> 21:03.570
Saber!

21:04.490 --> 21:07.200
Oh, sorry, Ayaka.

21:07.580 --> 21:11.250
I was planning on protecting
the church to the end...

21:11.250 --> 21:13.630
but I kind of screwed up.

21:14.380 --> 21:17.130
It's fine! Just hurry up
and get your wounds treated!

21:17.130 --> 21:19.130
I'm sure the church has
bandages or something!

21:20.050 --> 21:24.180
You really aren't a Mage
through and through.

21:24.640 --> 21:28.520
Your feelings serve
as a better medicinal herb than bandages.

21:28.520 --> 21:30.480
Stop joking!

21:33.600 --> 21:35.310
We have to hurry out of here!

21:38.280 --> 21:39.860
Hold it! Wait!

21:39.860 --> 21:42.570
If I made a citizen who I must protect
do such a thing...

21:42.570 --> 21:45.410
it would be a disgrace to me
both as a knight and as a king.

21:46.030 --> 21:48.200
At the point you're hanging out
with someone like me,

21:48.200 --> 21:50.410
it's already been a disgrace
the whole time!

21:51.290 --> 21:53.040
Just hurry up!

21:53.790 --> 21:58.170
And having you
depreciating yourself like that...

21:58.170 --> 22:00.380
is a disgrace to me as a Heroic Spirit.

22:07.010 --> 22:10.020
EPISODE 10
